@startuml OOPomanContext
left to right direction

actor Student
actor "Course owner\n(Roman)" as Owner
rectangle "OOPoman local site\n(runs in the student's browser)" as Site {
  component "Welcome, lessons,\ninteractive checks, points" as CourseUI
  component "Week availability\n(Week 1 initially open)" as Availability
}
folder "OOP-course/\n(owner-provided course files)" as Materials

Student --> CourseUI : learns and completes activities
CourseUI --> Materials : reads course content
Owner --> Availability : authorizes opening Weeks 2 and 3

note bottom of Site
  Local use only. No project-owned server,
  database, registration, or authentication.
  Score persistence and code execution design
  remain open decisions.
end note
@enduml
